<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle Friday roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle Friday roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet in Kansas Friday with no sales of slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry and demand were fair.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed last week on 146,500 head (record weekly volume) including 31,700 head or about 22 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle. Bids $63.00 with extra days, asking $64.00-65.00. Last sales $63.00 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
